source_event:           SymPol shared r11 had valid libsympol.so.0.1 SONAME and normal symlinks but DT_RPATH [/../lib], then failed to load its own library. r12 moved the literal loader token from cache_variables to tc.variables: native Conan RC0, upstream 30/30, installed consumer 4/4, full W3_PASS with 12 receipts. Log SHA256 de902547f695d50e2eef2769b77eec2b8282821cd071e588c9af436c4d040697.

